      ],
      "text": "Role in infants and children:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " GERD unresponsive to feeding and positioning chgs: a PPI (North American and European societies); typical PPI: lansoprazole orally once a day; responders cont several months, then taper and stop; nonresponders: look for another cause."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "PPIs are contraindicated w rilpivirine-containing prod."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Hypomagnesemia (rare, USU after a yr of therapy) can cause tetany, arrhythmias and seizures; consider checking magnesium b4 starting and periodically w prolonged tx, or w digoxin or drugs that can cause hypomagnesemia (eg, diuretics)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Omeprazole w MTX (mainly ↑dose) may raise and prolong MTX levels, possibly causing toxicity; a temp PPI hold may be considered w ↑dose MTX."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
